        <activityName xml:lang="en">Uranium natural, at mine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Uranium natural, at mine
The shares reflect the average worldwide production of open pit and underground mines around year 2000. The chemical extraction of uranium is not taken into account, although its share for the uranium production worldwide has been increasing (nearly 30% of total in year 2000). ;
UUID: 998297bd-b18b-3654-94c8-30a6a93f78b5
